description:
Step into the inner world of Mexican pop powerhouse @Danna  in this episode of Watch History.

As she enters her new EP and prepares to take the stage in Mentiras: All Stars, the 'Latin Pop Princess' sits down to share the videos she actually watches on repeat.

From her own legendary MTV MIAW performances and throwbacks to her Elite days, to late-night chill sessions with Healing Vibrations crystal singing bowls, find out what fuels DANNA's creative fire when she's off the clock. Start off her new era right with this amazing episode of Watch History.

